window.products.push({"id":515027,"name":"jinchan Embroidered Sheer Curtains for Living Room Embroidery Grommet Top Decorative Curtains Light Filtering Window Treatment Sets for Bedroom 2 Pane","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtCdWXOiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bring style home with CKNY HOME FASHION products and define your own individual personality and style. Functional: Sample natural color and design sheer window curtains help make room look cozy, without having them draw all the attention away from the rest of the room. Perfect wide and long to look much nicer than usual narrow ones, especially on bigger windows.  Pool on the floor at just the right amount, but people can't see inside and outside to create privacy. Light color helps brighten up the room and dark color helps darken room better.  Kindly Reminder: For proper fullness, panels should be measured 2-3 times the width of your window.  Sizes and colors Include: 2 Panels/pack 55 x 63\" 55 x 84\" 55 x 100\"  Measured from top of the upper grommet to the bottom of the lower grommet, exclusive of headers. White, Beige, grey, blue, burgundy red, royal blue available now, which color do you prefer?","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtCdWXOiL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jinchan","source_asin":"B08QYQ9BKZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515027","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08QYQ9BKZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08QYQ9BKZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":515028,"name":"Shalinindia Jungle Animals Door Curtains - Set of 2 Curtain Panels for a Baby Nursery or Toddler or Kids Bedroom - 48\" x 84\" Panels","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fBgQzKd9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It can be a jungle out there! That's why you want to make sure your child's room is as comfortable and cheerful as possible, so he or she has the perfect place to escape to when it's time to say goodnight or take a nap. The Jungle Animals Curtains are sure to set the tone for fun and help your little one rest by blocking out the sun! Perfect for a jungle themed nursery, toddler's bedroom or child's bedroom, the Jungle Animals Curtains are sold in a set of two. Each panel measures 48 inches by 84 inches in size, making the curtains ideal for hanging on most standard Doors. The curtains feature a highly detailed digital print with a menagerie of animal friends, including giraffes, elephants, monkeys, zebras, antelopes, lions, hippos, toucans and owls. These curtains are also great for use in playrooms and in day cares! By day, the Jungle Animals Curtains bring bold colors to the decor of the room, and by night and during naptime, they do an excellent job of keeping out light. That's because these curtain panels are made from 240-gram heavy polyester satin fabric with 100 % blackout properties. The weight of the material gives the drapes an attractive, flowing look as they hang, and our fabric is resistant to dust to cut down on the need for frequent cleaning. Hanging the curtains is easy with the rustproof grommets included in the top. When it does come time to give the Jungle Animals Curtains a good washing, you can launder them in cold water in your washing machine. Soaking is not necessary or recommended. Afterward, the curtains can be drip dried on the line in the shade. The quality of the fabric allows it to resist wrinkling, making ironing usually unnecessary. If you do need to remove wrinkles, do so on the lowest iron setting with no steam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91fBgQzKd9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B01DA3T82E","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DA3T82E","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DA3T82E","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
