window.products.push({"id":515131,"name":"Duwenem Bath Tub and Shower Mat - Extra Long 38 x 14 Inch Non-Slip Bathtub Mats with Drain Holes and Suction Cups, Machine Washable TPE Bath Mat for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611f+ssUqJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY CHOOSE US: 1. TPE Bath Mat: Our bathroom mats are made of high quality TPE (Thermoplastic rubber), Free of BPA, PAHS, PAES, POFA, etc. Which has better environmental protection, resilience, slip resistance and feel than PVC plastic bathroom mats. 2. Easy to Clean: Machine washable mat bath. Simply throw the mat in your washing machine on cold with gentle detergent and air dry. 3. Perfect Design: 14 x 38 inches, fits any size bathtub or shower. More than 100 powerful suction cups ensure a firm and secure, hundreds of large-aperture drainage holes do not have to worry about water accumulation. 4. Comfort Massage Mat: The bathtub mat with round hole and texture can also be a fashion and convenient massage shower mat for kids, adult and elderly. 5. Versatile Bath Tub Mat: Our floor mat is versatile for home bathroom and it’s a perfect addition for hotels, gyms, saunas, spas, and anywhere else you need a premium baby bath mat. Not only the bath mat can be placed inside the bathtub but also outside the tub. In addition, it can also be used under the sink, in the kitchen. RECOMMENDED MEASURES: 1. It is recommended soaking the mat in a tub by warm water for 10 minutes prior to your first use to make the bath mat unfold. 2. Before using, moisten the tub with a little bit of water and aim at the center mat with suction cups on under side, applying moderate pressure to attach the suction cups onto the tub floor. 3. We recommend rinsing and drying your bathmat periodically. The bath mat should be hung up over the tub or somewhere else after use. IMPORTANT: 1. Our bath mats work on smooth, non-textured shower tub floors. Textured and tiled surfaces do not support proper suction to the surface. 2. Do not use bath oils and jump on the tub mat to avoid slipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611f+ssUqJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Duwenem","source_asin":"B097P4XLQZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097P4XLQZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097P4XLQZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":515132,"name":"ufengke Yixing Zi Sha Tea Cup with Tea Strainer,Lid & Chinese Words Tea for One Handmade Ceramic Teapot,Purple Clay Tea Cup,21oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wZjz1NgaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"About Yixing Zisha Teapot The first Zisha teapot was created during the Song Dynasty in the 10th century. A monk in Yixing handmade the teapot from local clay. Today, Zisha teapots produced in Yixing City are considered to be the best tool for making tea. Use & Maintenance They are meant for use with black and oolong teas, green or white tea as well as aged pu'er tea, but the water must be allowed to cool to around 185 degree(F) before pouring the water into the pot. The using steps as follow:  1. When use the teapot at the first time, put the teapot into clean pot with cold water and boiling for about 5-10 minutes. Then remove the pot from the boiling water and set aside for natural cooling. This step can open the pores of teapot and make the tea more breathable.  2. Please put the tea into the Zisha pot and brew with warm water around 185 degree(F), wait for some minutes to enjoy your tea either by pouring it into a cup or by drinking directly from the Zisha teapot, which is the traditional way of using it.  Yixing teapots absorb a tiny amount of tea into the pot during brewing. After prolonged use, the pot will develop a coating that retains the flavor and color of the tea. It should be rinsed with fresh water and allowed to air-dry. A studious tea connoisseur will only steep one type of tea in a particular pot, so as not to corrupt the flavor that has been absorbed. (NOTE: FORBIDDEN IN MICROWAVE ,OVEN OR DISHWASHER) How to identify The Yixing teapot is good or bad can be judged from five aspects: raw clay type, modeling, feature, craftsman, function. According to the special requirements of the teapot forming crafts, the spout and the pot handle should be absolutely in line, and the weight should be balanced; the combination of the spout and the lid should be tight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wZjz1NgaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ufengke","source_asin":"B07GJML121","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GJML121","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GJML121","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
