window.products.push({"id":515217,"name":"MILPROX F4 Portable Neck Fan,Rechargeable Hands Free Bladeless Personal Mini Fans,3 Speeds 70 Air Outlet, Adjustment Wearable Personal Cooling Fan for","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616BLVy9b5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【WHY CHOOSE】:This portable fan allows you to truly free your hands and enjoy cool wind anytime, anywhere. It not only keeps you from overheating but also keeps your glasses from fogging up with mask on. Must have for work, sports, travel, hiking, cycling and so on; best gift for who you care. 【WHAT'S THE DIFFERENCE】 As a new design in 2021, this personal fan has been improved on the basis of the traditional neck fan. It is combined with the design and wearing concept of the headset, which can effectively prevent long hair from being curled. The fan’s motor has been upgraded to reduce noise, it is quiet enough to hear your own breath while running.Besides, it weights only 260g and easy to carry. 【3 GEAR SPEEDS & 70 AIR OUTLETS】3 wind speeds can be selected and turbo fan blades are more energy-saving and more efficient. The neck band can be 360° rotated, you can adjust the direction and speed at will and enjoy the cool wind from any angle. 【Long Batter Life & Type C Rechargeable】With 2400 mAh large capacity battery and Type C charging port, the neckband fan can be fully charged with wall charger, laptop and power bank in 2~3 hours and provide 3-8 working hours duration(depend on different speeds). 【Soft & Comfortable】The neckband fan is made of Eco-friendly ABS and soft silicone, no harm to skin, waterproof and durable. Light weight and anti-slip design for long term wearing, you won’t feel uncomfortable or tired when you hang the fan for a long time.Besides, we provide the 18 months warranty and professional friendly support., you are feel free to contact us anytime you need.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616BLVy9b5S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MILPROX","source_asin":"B0C1Z548G1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515217","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1Z548G1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1Z548G1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
