window.products.push({"id":515420,"name":"Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 25Kpa/250W Powerful Suction，5 in 1 Lightweight Stick Vacuum Cleaner, Up to 45 Mins Runtime, for Pet Hair/Snack Crumbs/Sofa Ga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JlTOTZVaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stick, Handheld 【25Kpa Powerful Suction】: The machine adopts the world's advanced brushless motor, the maximum speed can reach 110,000 speed, and the noise is only 68dB. With the strong power of 250W, it can handle a variety of life cleaning scenarios. For example: soot, pet hair, snack debris, cat litter, broken small gravel, etc.; two-speed mode 13Kpa and 25Kpa, switch at any time, simple and practical. 【45 Minutes Long Lasting Runtime】: VICSQO stick vacuum cleaner cordless can provide up to 45 mins running time under low mode, 15 mins on high mode. Equipped with detachable 2500 mAh battery in the vacuum cleaner, fully charge for 4 hours, can complete the cleaning of the large apartment. 【Flexible Motorized Brush with LED Light】: The vacuum cleaner uses different spectrum of white light, which can help you quickly find the dust under the TV cabinet, the dust under the coffee table, the particles on the carpet. And the floor brush can be rotated 180° horizontally and 90° up and down without any dead angle, which can easily solve the garbage at all angles. 【5 in 1 Flexible Combination】: The cordless vacuum cleaner set comes with a 2 in 1 hard brush/sofa brush/wall mount, which can easily change it from a stick vacuum cleaner to a handheld vacuum cleaner and easily hang it on the wall. 5-in-1 flexible combination, suitable for cleaning garbage in different scenarios: pet hair on the sofa, dust on the desk, dust on the ceiling, dust on the curtains, dust on the keyboard and crevices, etc. 【7*24H Professional After Sales】: One-click emptying system allows you to quickly clean up the garbage and keep away any dust and sundries. NOTE: Regular cleaning of the filter and HEPA will prevent reduced suction and clogging, please wait for the filter and HEPA to dry before installing it back into the vacuum. Our product warranty is one year. Therefore, if you encounter any problems in use, please contact us in time, we will reply and solve your problems as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JlTOTZVaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VICSQO","source_asin":"B09P7XYFL5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515420","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09P7XYFL5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09P7XYFL5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
