window.products.push({"id":515476,"name":"Cuisinox Milk Frother - Stainless steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M7DpA3IHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Perfect cappuccino is easy with this ingenious frother. This manual, pump action frother transforms hot milk into a luxuriously thick creamy topping for your freshly brewed coffee or espresso. You can heat milk, produce froth, and serve it in this stainless steel pot. Useful with hot or cold milk, the frother can also be used for creating luscious café au lait, café lattes, whipping milk shakes, or beating egg whites. Size: 800 mLCapacity: 800 millilitres/27 ouncesMaterials: Stainless steelCare: Dishwasher safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31M7DpA3IHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinox","source_asin":"B00BM88DDU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BM88DDU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BM88DDU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":515477,"name":"Lodge Enamel Cast-Iron 7-Quart Dutch Oven, Liberty Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318N4F9GGTL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Cast iron is prized for distributing heat evenly and keeping food warm long after it's taken from the oven. The Lodge Enamel 7-qt. Dutch Oven, made of solid cast iron, has 4 chip-resistant layers of blue enamel baked onto each piece for a super-durable (and beautiful) surface. The tight-fitting lid retains moisture for tender, juicy roasts, and a stainless steel grip gives the classic pot a modern touch. Stovetop, oven, fridge and freezer safe. Hand wash. Imported. 5Hx11-1/2Wx11-1/2L\". Amazon.com Lodge Enamel is the more upscale of the two enameled cast iron lines from this respected American cast iron cookware company. Sleeker and more contemporary in form than Lodge Color enameled cast iron, and featuring a stylish L-shaped lid knob made of stainless-steel, Lodge Enamel cast iron cookware is coated with four, not two, glossy coats of hard-as-nails porcelain enamel that is imported from France. The exterior color is uniform, not gradated, and is nicely set off by a cream interior. The lid is oven-safe up to 500 degrees F, so you can start a stew or casserole on the stovetop and finish by baking it in the oven. The 7-quart Dutch oven measures 11-3/8 inches in diameter and 5 inches deep, perfect for slow-simmering stews, casseroles, and chicken-and-rice dishes. Lodge enameled cast iron makes a smart choice due to its versatility-you can marinate raw meats in it, since it won't absorb odors or flavors, and you can braise, sauté, simmer, and bake in it. Made in China to Lodge's meticulous specifications, each cookware item is first clad in matte black enamel before the color is added. The black rim that shows on the oven is actually the scratch-resistant matte enamel, not the raw cast iron. Though the Dutch oven is dishwasher-safe, washing by hand is recommended to best preserve the glossy finish. Look also for the less expensive, more traditionally styled Lodge Color series, in a different set of colors and sizes to suit any kitchen. All Lodge enameled ware is covered by a lifetime warranty against defects. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/318N4F9GGTL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lodge","source_asin":"B00023CFWQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515477","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00023CFWQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00023CFWQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
