window.products.push({"id":515997,"name":"Costzon Kids Recliner Chair with Cup Holder, Adjustable Lounge Chair w/Footrest & Side Pockets for Children Boys Girls Room, Ergonomic Toddler Furnitu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":145.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uIITKAmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Selected Materials & Stable Structure: The surface of this kid’s recliner is covered with high-quality PU leather, which is skin-friendly, breathable and easy to clean. The sturdy solid wood frame enables the recliner to withstand up to 120 lbs of weight without collapsing. Besides, 4 anti-slip feet ensure that the chair can stand stably on the floor. Adjustable Backrest & Footrest: Featuring a smooth pushback mechanism, the backrest can be reclined up to 130°. Children can sit up straight to read a book or watch TV, or lie down to take a nap. When kids lean back, the footrest will pop out and fully extend, allowing their feet to be well rested. Convenient Cup Holders & Side Pockets: The armrests on both sides are designed with a cup holder, which can put the kids’ water cups within their reach, so that they can be hydrated in time when they are thirsty. In addition, large side pocket and two small front pockets are convenient for storing children's favorite books and snacks. Comfortable Ergonomic Design: This kid’s recliner is ergonomically designed with a high backrest and wide armrests for extra support to relieve sedentary fatigue. Soft and thick sponge-padded seat provides an ultra-comfortable sitting feeling, allowing children to get full relaxation. Ideal Gift for Kids: Our recliner chair is the ideal choice for kids to spend their leisure time. It is larger than other products on the market and is suitable for children over 3 years old. The simple and modern design makes it suitable for a variety of places, such as children's room, living room and bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61uIITKAmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Costzon","source_asin":"B08THMN4HG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-515997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08THMN4HG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08THMN4HG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
